B = [
('Cadillac','North America','1950s-present','cars','In the style of Cadillac, American luxury that mixes jet-age glamour with a sharp modern edge. Forms are long, low and wide with crisp vertical blades, razor creases and polished chrome edging. The emblem is a shield crest with a laurel wreath, shown as a jewelled multi-colour badge in retro work and as a flat monochrome black or silver outline in current work. Palette is pearl white, midnight black, champagne gold, deep ruby red and powder pink, with mirror-bright metal throughout. Lettering is wide, airy, widely spaced capitals or a flowing cursive. Materials include tufted leather, glossy lacquer, cut glass and stitched suede. Photography is cinematic, with dusk skies, neon reflections and dramatic dark backdrops.'),
('Honda','East Asia','1980s-present','cars','In the style of Honda, clever, friendly and precise Japanese engineering expressed through clean, light forms. Shapes are compact and tidy, with thin crisp edges, gently rounded corners, and sporty swept wedges that end in a neat squared cut. Palette is championship white, signal red, deep blue, silver and black, with red used as a small energetic accent. The emblem is a simple upright capital letter H with slightly splayed sides, set in chrome or flat white on blue, black or red. Lettering is a plain, sturdy, wide sans-serif in bold capitals. Surfaces are glossy enamel, brushed aluminium and matte plastic. Photography is bright, optimistic and airy, with open skies, clean studio white backdrops and dynamic motion blur.'),
('Subaru','East Asia','1990s-present','cars','In the style of Subaru, practical, sturdy and adventurous design with a rally-bred streak. Shapes are boxy and honest, with squared-off volumes, flared curves, short overhangs and bold raised bulges. The emblem is a blue oval holding a cluster of six silver stars, seen in glossy chrome, flat white or embossed relief. Palette is saturated rally blue with gold accents, plus white, silver, black, forest green and warm orange. Lettering is a solid, wide, geometric sans-serif in capitals, sometimes italic and stencil-cut for sporty graphics. Materials are hardwearing woven fabric with bright contrast stitching, rubberised textures, matte plastic and scuffed metal. Photography is dramatic outdoor adventure, with mountain roads, snow, mud spray, night skies and glowing blue light.'),
('Mazda','East Asia','2010s-present','cars','In the style of Mazda, calm, elegant, restrained design rooted in Japanese minimalism and a feeling of motion even when still. Surfaces are smooth and sculpted, with soft flowing highlights and reflections instead of hard creases, long graceful proportions and fine, slender chrome lines. The emblem is a slim circle holding an open winged capital M, drawn in a thin metallic outline, and the wordmark is airy, widely spaced and light in weight. Palette is deep crystal red, machine grey, soft pearl white, charcoal and black. Materials include matte metal, burgundy and cream leather, natural wood and fine stitching. Photography is moody and cinematic, with dark studio backdrops, pools of light, dusk cityscapes and generous empty space.'),
('Dior','Europe','1947-present','fashion','In the style of Dior, Parisian couture refinement with soft feminine grace. Silhouettes are structured and sculpted, with nipped waists, rounded curves, full flowing volumes and delicate ribbon bows. Palette is dove grey, pearl white, blush pink, navy, black and touches of gold. Signature surfaces include a repeating oblique pattern of interlocking capital letters in navy, grey or tan, a stitched diamond lattice quilting, houndstooth, toile de Jouy scenes and garden florals in pastel embroidery. Lettering is a spaced, elegant serif in capitals or a fine cursive. Packaging uses grey boxes, ribbons and gold-sparkled prints. Photography is airy, painterly and romantic, with soft daylight, Riviera terraces, pastel gardens and cool dreamy tones.'),
('Prada','Europe','1913-present','fashion','In the style of Prada, severe, intellectual minimalism with deadpan, slightly odd elegance. Shapes are pared-back, geometric and utilitarian, with flat planes, clean seams and a triangular enamel plaque as the signature emblem. Materials are matte black industrial nylon, saffiano cross-hatch leather, brushed metal, glossy plastic and sheer technical fabrics. Palette is black, white, grey, pale mint, powder blue, sage, mustard and dusty pink, with deliberately off-beat pairings and sudden acid accents. Lettering is a classic high-contrast serif in capitals with the word Milano beneath, often framed by a black rope or chain border. Packaging is tidy pale boxes and tags in soft pastels. Photography is cool, stark and unsmiling, with clinical lighting and flat colour backgrounds.'),
('Versace','Europe','1980s-present','fashion','In the style of Versace, maximal, flamboyant, high-shine glamour inspired by Roman antiquity and pop. The signature emblem is a gold medusa head medallion, framed by a repeating Greek key meander border, with baroque scrolls, acanthus leaves, garlands and ornate filigree. Palette is rich gold, jet black, crisp white, deep burgundy, royal blue, hot pink, turquoise and sunshine yellow, often clashing in dense, dizzying prints. Materials are silk, satin, embossed leather, metallic mesh, gilded hardware and lacquer. Lettering is bold, wide, sharp-edged capitals in gold or white on black. Packaging is black and red boxes with gilded patterns. Photography is sun-drenched, sensual and theatrical, with glossy skin tones, dark backdrops and glowing gold light.'),
('Fendi','Europe','1925-present','fashion','In the style of Fendi, Roman luxury, witty, tactile and richly crafted. The core pattern is a repeating monogram of two mirrored capital letters, shown in brown on tan, black and white, or bright colours, and used on wallpaper-like grids, ribbons and bold single-motif graphics. Materials are plush fur, fine leather, woven strips, marquetry-like patchwork and smooth lacquer, with sleek clean shapes in camel, tan, chocolate, black, cream and sunny golden yellow. Playful touches include candy-coloured trims, leopard spots and cartoon-eyed charms. Lettering is a heavy, tightly stacked sans-serif in capitals. Packaging is mustard yellow boxes with black edging, and sleek black gift cartons. Photography is high-fashion, graphic and humorous, with strong flat colour backdrops.'),
('Dr Martens','Europe','1960s-present','footwear','In the style of Dr Martens, defiant British rebellion with chunky, hardwearing, scuffed-and-loved attitude. Surfaces are glossy or crinkled leather in black and cherry red, with visible contrast stitching in bright yellow, thick matte rubber textures and metal studs. Palette is sulphur yellow and black as the signature pairing, with cherry red, white and occasional floral, tartan or acid-bright prints. Lettering is hand-drawn and uneven, with a bouncing baseline and a rough marker or stencil feel, often with an arched wordmark. Graphics lean on collage, torn paper, photocopied zine textures, stickers, stars and bold slogans in the spirit of punk gig posters. Photography is raw and gritty, with flash lighting, high contrast, close crops and streets, gigs and youthful rebellious crowds.'),
('Fred Perry','Europe','1950s-present','sportswear','In the style of Fred Perry, neat, tidy British sporting heritage with a mod and subculture edge. The emblem is a laurel wreath, stitched or printed in white, black or gold, often alone on a plain field. Surfaces are fine knitted pique, soft cotton, crisp woven twill and clean tailored lines. Signature graphic is the twin-tipped stripe in contrasting colours, appearing as trim on edges and borders. Palette is navy, white, black, racing green, burgundy and cream, with sharp contrast pairings like yellow on black or red and white on navy. Lettering is a clean, wide-spaced, light sans-serif in capitals, sometimes within a round badge. Packaging is cream and navy cartons with simple wreath marks. Photography is understated and stylish, with youthful street portraits and soft natural light.'),
]
